---
title: Help centre search that understands typos
status: published
excerpt: Customers now find the right article even when they misspell what they're looking for.
categories:
  - new
date: 2026-10-19
author: Jonah Ellis
---

Help centre search now tolerates typos and plurals, and shows the best paragraph from each article in the results.

It's on for every help centre — nothing to switch on.
